{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17779","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 六 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"代是文明昼，春当宴喜时。\n罏烟添柳重，宫漏出花迟。\n汉典方宽律，周官正采诗。\n碧宵传凤吹，红旭在龙旗。\n造化膺神契，阳和沃圣思。\n无因随百兽，率舞奉丹墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}